    "huggingface-qwen35-reference-gdn": {
      "adaptation": "Exact-artifact Qwen3.5 BF16 gated DeltaNet boundaries and the 64-token torch_chunk_gated_delta_rule equations. Separate Rust/Metal phases preserve F32 scratch and recurrent state, source padding, unit-lower triangular solve, causal chunk output and state transitions. Source numerical details and SLEEF adaptations are recorded separately; no Transformers runtime dependency.",
      "additional_notices": [
